@@title SQ-TP Tempad port: upstream bug fixes and whole-mod checks, 2026-11-07 ([immersive_portals.md](../immersive_portals.md) 2.1.1, TODO `gameplay/tnt-and-portal #9`, member notes `development/creativeCompat/members/tempad/PORT_NOTES.md` 6.12, 6.16.15)
