@group dedicated
@commands whole mod, all four phases on a dedicated server with Curios, FTB Teams and WTHIT: join with a client; run SQ-TP-04, -09, -13, -16, -19 once each from the client; a second client joins and sees the doors
@pass server reaches `Done (`, no client-class or `NoClassDefFoundError` in the server log; both clients see doors, markers, WTHIT lines; no disconnects on any tempad packet
@fails client-only class reached from common code; packet ids (registration order in `ModNetworking`)
@draft no batch holds this row yet
