@@text Not run. Targets `creativecompat-1.0.0.jar` built 2026-11-07 12:01 (build/libs, not in `mods/`; prep_srv.sh swaps it in).
@@text Same setup as SQ-TP-01 (donor in `tempad_upstream/`, Immersive Portals / Portal Gun / Portal Gels / loadingscreentips
