@group A
@commands #11 break after a restart (SQ-TP-25 again): after SQ-TP-36's restart break the marker in survival, `/ztp pickup`, `/ztp anchors`; re-place it 20 blocks away; `/ztp open qa tempad:markers <name>` and use the card in a projector
@pass the anchor entry is gone after the break; the drop has `anchor_id` = the card's id; after the re-place the entry points at the new place and the door / projector open there
@fails `AbstractMarkerBlock.onRemove` (needs `marker.id`); `getDrops` `setAnchorId`; `SpatialAnchorItem.adoptStoredId`
