@commands #11 copies: `/give` a marker item carrying a standing marker's `anchor_id` and place it; `/give` a marker with `BlockEntityTag:{anchor_id:"<standing marker's id>"}` (what creative ctrl-pick writes) and place it (`op qa` first: vanilla applies BlockEntityTag only for ops)
@pass both copies get their own new id (`/ztp anchors` one entry each), the standing marker keeps its id and its cards still open to it
